  "description": "A research sandbox for the Hellas Protocol, a high-throughput decentralized compute network employing an object-centric state model and the Morpheus BFT consensus. The architecture utilizes a DAG-based block structure with dual-phase execution to maintain performance during network instability. It incorporates the Muchin simulation framework for deterministic protocol modeling and Leptos-based interactive visualization tools.",
